WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.112
Your changes in Drupal Canvas are saved as a draft. Visitors see them only after you publish. Here a content admin publishes a change.

2
00:00:11.112 --> 00:00:38.165
We insert a pattern, so the page has one unpublished change. The review button now counts it.

3
00:00:38.165 --> 00:00:45.735
Click the review button. Nothing is ticked yet, so tick the change, or click Select All.

4
00:00:45.735 --> 00:00:51.619
Click Publish one selected. The page is now live for visitors.
